{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Have you ever seen a car move down the road?","words":[[0,0.28],[0.33,0.42],[0.51,0.79],[0.86,1.11],[1.17,1.2],[1.28,1.64],[1.73,1.97],[2.02,2.23],[2.28,2.35],[2.42,3.06]]},{"text":"Inside the car is a machine called an engine.","words":[[0,0.6],[0.65,0.72],[0.79,1.1],[1.18,1.3],[1.36,1.38],[1.45,1.88],[1.94,2.24],[2.29,2.38],[2.48,3.39]]},{"text":"The engine helps the car move forward.","words":[[0,0.22],[0.33,0.71],[0.77,1.07],[1.11,1.18],[1.26,1.59],[1.68,1.94],[2.01,2.97]]},{"text":"Engines need fuel to work. Fuel gives the engine energy.","words":[[0,0.56],[0.64,0.86],[0.93,1.21],[1.29,1.36],[1.44,1.88],[2.06,2.37],[2.44,2.71],[2.73,2.82],[2.91,3.32],[3.39,4.23]]},{"text":"When fuel burns inside the engine, it creates power.","words":[[0,0.29],[0.43,0.81],[0.91,1.28],[1.35,1.79],[1.81,1.88],[1.96,2.37],[2.43,2.55],[2.62,3.08],[3.16,3.99]]},{"text":"This power pushes small parts inside the engine up and down.","words":[[0,0.29],[0.38,0.77],[0.86,1.26],[1.32,1.67],[1.75,2.11],[2.17,2.53],[2.55,2.62],[2.71,3.08],[3.13,3.29],[3.34,3.44],[3.52,4.32]]},{"text":"These moving parts turn the car’s wheels.","words":[[0,0.34],[0.41,0.76],[0.85,1.23],[1.29,1.53],[1.58,1.65],[1.71,2.08],[2.16,3.02]]},{"text":"When the wheels turn, the car moves forward.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.29,0.36],[0.42,0.84],[0.92,1.49],[1.7,1.82],[1.9,2.17],[2.25,2.55],[2.65,3.62]]},{"text":"Engines are also used in trucks, buses, and airplanes.","words":[[0,0.46],[0.51,0.67],[0.73,1.03],[1.14,1.37],[1.42,1.51],[1.58,2.02],[2.1,2.62],[2.65,2.76],[2.83,3.9]]},{"text":"Fuel gives energy, and engines turn that energy into motion.","words":[[0,0.41],[0.49,0.74],[0.84,1.42],[1.44,1.64],[1.78,2.29],[2.35,2.59],[2.65,2.81],[2.89,3.3],[3.35,3.56],[3.65,4.5]]}]}